sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title YuPay — fulfillment skeleton (mock supplier, dev/staging only)

    participant U as User
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant PAY as payments.service
    participant FUL as fulfillment.service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant MOCK as MockFulfiller

    Note over U,MOCK: Payment webhook drives fulfilment

    U->>API: POST /webhooks/payments/mock {event_id, payment_id, succeeded}
    API->>PAY: handle_webhook
    PAY->>DB: UPDATE payments SET status='succeeded'
    PAY->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status='paid', paid_at=now()
    PAY->>DB: INSERT order_events(order.paid)
    PAY->>FUL: start_for_order(order_id)
    FUL->>DB: SELECT existing fulfillment_tasks (idempotency)
    FUL->>DB: INSERT fulfillment_tasks per order_item
    FUL->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status='fulfilling'
    FUL->>DB: INSERT order_events(order.fulfilling)

    loop per task
        FUL->>DB: UPDATE task.status='in_progress'
        FUL->>MOCK: fulfill(order, item, idempotency_key=task.id)
        MOCK-->>FUL: FulfillResult(succeeded, external_order_id, artifact)
        FUL->>DB: INSERT fulfillment_attempts(kind='fulfill', status='ok')
        FUL->>DB: UPDATE task.status='succeeded', external_order_id=?, succeeded_at=now()
        FUL->>DB: INSERT deliveries(channel='in_app', artifact_kind='voucher_code', artifact={code})
        FUL->>DB: UPDATE order_items.fulfillment_state='delivered'
    end

    Note over FUL,DB: Settle order if every task succeeded

    FUL->>DB: SELECT all tasks for order
    alt all succeeded
        FUL->>DB: UPDATE orders SET status='delivered', fulfilled_at=?, delivered_at=now()
        FUL->>DB: INSERT order_events(order.delivered)
    end

    API-->>U: 200 {status: "processed"}
